kind: TaskDialog
modelDescription: |-
  Saves one explicitly requested classification for an existing candidate linked to the supplied discovery run. Requires exact DiscoveryRunID, CandidateID, SourceURL, an allowed CandidateKind, and a supporting ClassificationRationale.

  Allowed values: EVENT_LEAD, MULTI_EVENT_SOURCE, OTHER_SOURCE, UNKNOWN. SourceURL must exactly match the saved CanonicalURL. Never invent IDs, URLs, evidence, or page contents. When relying only on a saved title or snippet, state that limitation in the rationale.

  Use only when the user explicitly requests saving a classification. Do not classify other candidates or retry automatically after an uncertain outcome. Report success only when the tool returns CLASSIFICATION_SAVED.

  This tool does not read websites, execute searches, extract individual events, verify event facts or eligibility, approve Gate 1, or confirm discovery completion.
outputs:
  - propertyName: candidateclassificationresult

action:
  kind: InvokeFlowTaskAction
  flowId: 31807836-57d1-f111-a05b-000d3a0aa2f5
  connectionProperties:
    $kind: ConnectionProperties
    diagnostics:
    mode: Invoker

outputMode: All